OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric maiden flight for
OL,4,Aisland-built plane
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first Islander aircraft to be built
OL,7,Fon the Isle of Wight in decades has
OL,8,Fcompleted its maiden flight.
OL,10,FFor more than 50 years, the
OL,11,FBritten-Norman BN-2 Islander was
OL,12,Fpredominantly manufactured in Romania
OL,13,Fand finished in Bembridge.
OL,15,FBut in 2023 production returned to the
OL,16,Fisland, with staff growing from 100 to
OL,17,F180.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
