OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric maiden flight for
OL,4,Aisland-built plane
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new aircraft, which flew on
OL,7,FThursday, will be painted in the
OL,8,Fcolours of the Falkland Islands
OL,9,FGovernment Air Service before being
OL,10,Fflown to the South Atlantic to serve as
OL,11,Fa transport link.
